        "path": "_m/e/y/c/s/lisbon-wk/there-lots-beautiful-n.jpg",
        "filename": "Lisbon Street, Portugal (8619812026).jpg",
        "caption": "There are lots of beautiful narrow streets in Lisbon and you can spend the whole day walking up and down.\nThis is an HDR of three handheld shots. There is a lot of contrast in the afternoon because the sun only falls on the top of the buildings. I made the end result look closest to the +2 shot, using the darker exposures to get the sky and the tops of the buildings. Used OnOne Perfect Effects to add a slight texture, most visible in the sky.",
        "alt": "There are lots of beautiful narrow streets in Lisbon and you can spend the whole day walking up and down.\nThis is an HDR of three handheld shots. There is a lot of contrast in the afternoon because the sun only falls on the top of the buildings. I made the end result look closest to the +2 shot, using the darker exposures to get the sky and the tops of the buildings. Used OnOne Perfect Effects to add a slight texture, most visible in the sky.",
        "width": 1619,
        "height": 1200,
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
        "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
        "artist": "Pedro Szekely from Los Angeles, USA",
